📝 println(switch (val) { case SealedType.TypeA() -> “A”; case SealedType。例如，假设我们用另一种 case 扩展我们的 SealedType： public sealed interface SealedType { record TypeA() Implements SealedType {} record TypeB() Implements SealedType {} record TypeC() Implements SealedType {} static SealedType of(String type) { return switch (type) { case “A” -> new TypeA(); case “B” -> new TypeB(); case “C” -> new TypeC(); 默认 -> throw new IllegalArgumentException(); };


🔤 Original: Java sealed classes and exhaustive pattern matching

